WEBVTT

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.244
Organize the fictional procedure using Context, Lead, Entry,

00:00:04.446 --> 00:00:09.027
Actions, Result, Exceptions and Record. State when it

00:00:09.073 --> 00:00:12.845
applies. Name the supplied practice operator and designated

00:00:12.935 --> 00:00:16.168
training reviewer. List the permitted input and current

00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:19.702
version. Order the checks and simulated action. Define

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:23.475
the quality result and completion evidence. Explain the

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.799
stop when approval is missing. Record the version,

00:00:27.113 --> 00:00:31.814
checks, status and open question using sanitized references.

00:00:32.114 --> 00:00:35.617
CLEARER is the seven-part operating standard. It is

00:00:35.706 --> 00:00:38.929
distinct from the five-part CLEAR Quality Review.
